{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/testing/craft-graph-vs-nx","title":"Craft graph vs Nx","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"craft-graph-vs-nx","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Craft graph vs Nx"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Nx organises the "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"workspace"}]},{"t":"text","text":". The Craft graph judges the "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"shape of one"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"app"}]},{"t":"text","text":". They are complementary — comparing "},{"t":"code","text":"depConstraints"},{"t":"text","text":" to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"assertHttpEndpointUnique"},{"t":"text","text":" is comparing a city plan to a wiring diagram."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use Nx when"}]},{"t":"text","text":" the constraint is about projects, TypeScript imports, or what"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"CI should rerun."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Use Craft when"}]},{"t":"text","text":" the constraint is about who may yield whom, who owns an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"HTTP endpoint, or whether a route proof stayed armed."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Not instead of"}]},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/testing/architecture","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"architecture rules"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — this"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"page is the why; that page is the how."}]},{"t":"callout","tone":"tip","caption":"They already run together","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The demo suite is an Nx target: "},{"t":"code","text":"npx nx architecture demo"},{"t":"text","text":". Craft does not"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"replace Nx; it adds a graph Nx cannot see."}]}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"two-graphs-two-altitudes","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Two graphs, two altitudes"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[],[{"t":"text","text":"Nx"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Craft"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"text","text":"Node"}],[{"t":"text","text":"an app or a lib"}],[{"t":"text","text":"a route, a service, a "},{"t":"code","text":"GET users"},{"t":"text","text":", a "},{"t":"code","text":"craftUnique"},{"t":"text","text":" identity"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Edge"}],[{"t":"text","text":"a TypeScript import ("},{"t":"code","text":"static"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"dynamic"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"implicit"},{"t":"text","text":")"}],[{"t":"code","text":"depends-on"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"provides"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"calls"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"writes"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"checks"},{"t":"text","text":", …"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Question"}],[{"t":"text","text":"who may import whom, and what should rerun?"}],[{"t":"text","text":"who may yield whom, and who owns this endpoint?"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Enforcement"}],[{"t":"text","text":"ESLint "},{"t":"code","text":"@nx/enforce-module-boundaries"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Vitest on the graph ("},{"t":"code","text":"assert*"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"noExclusiveLink"},{"t":"text","text":")"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Visualisation"}],[{"t":"code","text":"nx graph"},{"t":"text","text":" — projects and tasks, "},{"t":"code","text":"--affected"}],[{"t":"code","text":"npx craft-graph --format html"},{"t":"text","text":" — a route expanding into services and HTTP"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Nx orchestrates. Craft asserts."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-nx-cannot-see","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What Nx cannot see"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Nx's node is a project. Everything inside "},{"t":"code","text":"apps/shop/src"},{"t":"text","text":" is opaque: routes,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"providers, "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"},{"t":"text","text":", HTTP, storage. That is not a bug — the project graph is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"built to be cheap enough to drive CI. The holes appear as soon as you want to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"judge an "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"app"}]},{"t":"text","text":", not a workspace."}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Nx sees"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Nx misses"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Craft counterpart"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"code","text":"demo"},{"t":"text","text":" imports "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/core"}],[{"t":"code","text":"yield* CheckoutApi"},{"t":"text","text":" in the same app"}],[{"t":"code","text":"depends-on"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Tags on a lib ("},{"t":"code","text":"scope:admin"},{"t":"text","text":")"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Two features that share one app"}],[{"t":"code","text":"assertPathBoundaries"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"noExclusiveLink"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"A circular import between libs"}],[{"t":"text","text":"A service cycle "},{"t":"code","text":"A → B → A"},{"t":"text","text":" inside one tsconfig"}],[{"t":"code","text":"assertNoDependencyCycles"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"That "},{"t":"code","text":"HttpClient"},{"t":"text","text":" was imported"}],[{"t":"text","text":"That "},{"t":"code","text":"GET users"},{"t":"text","text":" is called from two APIs"}],[{"t":"code","text":"assertHttpEndpointUnique"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Nothing about storage keys"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Two queries sharing a "},{"t":"code","text":"craftUnique"},{"t":"text","text":" identity"}],[{"t":"code","text":"assertCraftUnique"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Nothing about unused type aliases"}],[{"t":"text","text":"A commented-out "},{"t":"code","text":"CanRun"},{"t":"text","text":" that still compiles"}],[{"t":"code","text":"assertRouteDiProofs"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Nothing about named buttons"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Two interactive helpers sharing "},{"t":"code","text":"data-craft-name"}],[{"t":"code","text":"assertInteractiveElementNamed"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Three consequences follow."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"An edge is an import, not DI."}]},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"yield* CheckoutApi"},{"t":"text","text":" does not cross a project"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"boundary. Module-boundary ESLint never fires. The Craft graph records it as"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"depends-on"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Isolation costs a library."}]},{"t":"text","text":" For "},{"t":"code","text":"depConstraints"},{"t":"text","text":" to protect a feature, that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"feature must be its own project — barrel, tags, often a build. Craft states"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the same intention on "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"folders"}]},{"t":"text","text":" and on yield, without extracting forty libs."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"ESLint judges a file."}]},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"@nx/enforce-module-boundaries"},{"t":"text","text":" sees one import."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"assertHttpEndpointUnique"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"assertRouteDiProofs"},{"t":"text","text":" see the whole graph,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"including lazy "},{"t":"code","text":"loadChildren"},{"t":"text","text":" collections a parent proof never covers."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Nx Enterprise Conformance can add workspace rules on the project graph and the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"file tree. Recreating Craft's AST analysis (DI, yield, HTTP) there would be"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"rewriting "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/dev-tools"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-craft-cannot-see","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What Craft cannot see"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The Craft graph is one TypeScript program ("},{"t":"code","text":"analyzeDependencyGraph"},{"t":"text","text":" takes one"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"tsconfig). It does not become a build system."}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Craft sees"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Craft misses"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Nx counterpart"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"text","text":"Who yields whom inside an app"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Which projects CI should rerun"}],[{"t":"text","text":"project graph + "},{"t":"code","text":"nx affected"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Folder lanes on "},{"t":"code","text":"depends-on"}],[{"t":"text","text":"A deep import that bypasses a lib's "},{"t":"code","text":"index.ts"}],[{"t":"code","text":"enforce-module-boundaries"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"A duplicate "},{"t":"code","text":"GET users"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Nest imported from a frontend project"}],[{"t":"code","text":"bannedExternalImports"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"A service cycle in "},{"t":"code","text":"apps/shop"}],[{"t":"code","text":"orders"},{"t":"text","text":" ↔ "},{"t":"code","text":"customers"},{"t":"text","text":" as libs"}],[{"t":"text","text":"circular project dependencies"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Craft TypeScript"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Python, Nest, assets, configs"}],[{"t":"text","text":"polyglot project graph, implicit deps"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"A failing Vitest assertion"}],[{"t":"text","text":"A generator that rewrites the file"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Conformance fix generators"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Seconds of ts-morph analysis"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Millisecond cache hits on unchanged libs"}],[{"t":"text","text":"local / remote computation cache"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The Craft graph "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"asserts"}]},{"t":"text","text":". The Nx graph "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"executes"}]},{"t":"text","text":": what to build, test,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"cache, parallelise. Without Nx (or an equivalent), a green architecture suite"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"does not scale in CI."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"assertPathBoundaries"},{"t":"text","text":" protects a modular monolith. It does not split the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"task"}]},{"t":"text","text":" graph. Changing one feature folder still invalidates the whole app"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"architecture target — analysis reloads the tsconfig, in seconds, not"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"milliseconds."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Craft is a TypeScript analyser. Outside that dialect the graph is empty."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Nx tags Nest, React, Python, assets and config files."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-overlap","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The overlap"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Same intention, different edge."}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Intention"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Nx"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Craft"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Trap"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"text","text":"This layer must not talk to that one"}],[{"t":"code","text":"sourceTag: type:ui"},{"t":"text","text":" → "},{"t":"code","text":"onlyDependOnLibsWithTags: type:util"}],[{"t":"code","text":"assertPathBoundaries"},{"t":"text","text":" — "},{"t":"code","text":"src/app/ui/**"},{"t":"text","text":" must not "},{"t":"code","text":"depends-on"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"src/app/data/**"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Nx requires libs. Craft runs inside one tsconfig, on yield, not on the import."}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"No cycles"}],[{"t":"code","text":"orders"},{"t":"text","text":" → "},{"t":"code","text":"customers"},{"t":"text","text":" → "},{"t":"code","text":"orders"},{"t":"text","text":" (project imports)"}],[{"t":"code","text":"assertNoDependencyCycles"},{"t":"text","text":" on services / "},{"t":"code","text":"craftComputed"}],[{"t":"text","text":"A service cycle inside "},{"t":"code","text":"apps/shop"},{"t":"text","text":" is green for Nx and red for Craft."}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"See the graph"}],[{"t":"code","text":"nx graph --affected"},{"t":"text","text":" (projects or tasks)"}],[{"t":"code","text":"craft-graph --format html"},{"t":"text","text":" centred on a route"}],[{"t":"text","text":"One shows who rebuilds. The other shows who injects."}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The "},{"t":"code","text":"assertPathBoundaries"},{"t":"text","text":" helper is the closest cousin of "},{"t":"code","text":"depConstraints"},{"t":"text","text":"."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Nx tags "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"projects"}]},{"t":"text","text":" and forbids TypeScript imports. Craft tags "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"folders"}]},{"t":"text","text":" on"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the Craft graph and forbids "},{"t":"code","text":"depends-on"},{"t":"text","text":" (optionally "},{"t":"code","text":"calls"},{"t":"text","text":") — including"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"inside one app, where module-boundary ESLint does not run. Setup and examples:"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/testing/architecture#assertpathboundaries","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Architecture rules"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"how-they-complement","children":[{"t":"text","text":"How they complement"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Do not recode "},{"t":"code","text":"depConstraints"},{"t":"text","text":" as Vitest, and do not recode Craft's AST"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"analysis as an Nx Conformance rule. Each tool stays on its graph."}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Keep Nx for"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Keep Craft for"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"text","text":"Monorepo layout, tags between libs, public API barrels"}],[{"t":"text","text":"HTTP ownership, "},{"t":"code","text":"craftUnique"},{"t":"text","text":" identities"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"nx affected"},{"t":"text","text":", local / remote cache, task graph"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Route DI proofs staying armed"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Banning an npm package by tag"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Pure "},{"t":"code","text":"craftComputed"},{"t":"text","text":", service-level cycles"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"Generators, plugins, polyglot projects"}],[{"t":"code","text":"noExclusiveLink"},{"t":"text","text":", browser-boundary HTTP"}]]]},{"t":"callout","tone":"warning","caption":"Folder lanes are not affected CI","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Extracting Nx libraries gives you "},{"t":"code","text":"nx affected"},{"t":"text","text":". It still does not prove a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"single service owns "},{"t":"code","text":"GET users"},{"t":"text","text":". "},{"t":"code","text":"assertPathBoundaries"},{"t":"text","text":" keeps features apart"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"inside one app. It still does not slice the task graph. Both layers stay"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"necessary."}]}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The working reference is the demo app: an Nx "},{"t":"code","text":"architecture"},{"t":"text","text":" target that runs"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Vitest on the Craft graph. Copy that layout from"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/testing/architecture#setting-it-up","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Architecture rules"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"see-also","children":[{"t":"text","text":"See Also"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/testing/architecture","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Architecture rules"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — helpers, catalog, Nx"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"target"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/routing/eslint-rules","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"ESLint rules"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — local slips the graph cannot"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"autofix"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"link","href":"/craft/learn/10-testing","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"Learn: test what you wrote"}]}]}]]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"two-graphs-two-altitudes","text":"Two graphs, two altitudes"},{"level":2,"id":"what-nx-cannot-see","text":"What Nx cannot see"},{"level":2,"id":"what-craft-cannot-see","text":"What Craft cannot see"},{"level":2,"id":"the-overlap","text":"The overlap"},{"level":2,"id":"how-they-complement","text":"How they complement"},{"level":2,"id":"see-also","text":"See Also"}]}